          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "PROV validity checks a consistent provenance history rather than establishing the factual truth of its assertions. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-constraints/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:da438a51dfc2947c6acb04d83d95247534971f237678beef15bdd6eadb2ec813",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:fbd04cc95967f828a6920570925cd1422c57616783de6325d2849d15eb8120d2"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "PROV represents a revised document as an entity derived from an earlier document entity. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-dm/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:e3d943d5fa77df35f57ab2f36a38e17045f275c4e4ff52bfa0b4191db1d57adb",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:8150da759a4c72204bc090c9e0653ed3c41478fc98f81c2db8f5302ca25a02b8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A retrospective correction changes the current account of valid history while preserving earlier recorded beliefs. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://docs.xtdb.com/about/time-in-xtdb.html",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:1a11a93a6d4627f1ff8c121c5458f9da050a617185415b3b8104d0b84650517f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:d5de996316649511437cd58ba6e6327fb674522fa983f8996db3f822ef285cf0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valid time can describe a future-effective change recorded before that change takes effect. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://docs.xtdb.com/about/time-in-xtdb.html",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d02fb5d34407b1f90dece6b57658160c578d5f08588b7a8dd238ce517f00986e",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:f745c274248334b6ea317813f63d361a46d7f57563b846e9193a55f9d8968e2f"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "XTDB's ordinary query defaults to current valid time and the best currently known system-time view. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-22)",
          "source": "https://docs.xtdb.com/about/time-in-xtdb.html",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:76b77c2550fb9de2e4d1f75b272bb1e2e8004643ab4fc4d4746c97b117248a4f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:d3da2cda5328b834a3efc3aa62c776db9f627c98606d78218490619d6a54ecf9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An audit query can select a past system time to exclude corrections learned later. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://docs.xtdb.com/about/time-in-xtdb.html",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:99e54baab84a8c0caf16b7830d242efad36259af0318c56bdeb4b8e618a3ceda",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:9c539d72368e1a8c000318a600bb4f92d7a93932262a5ee9597f470295690eea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PROV entities have fixed aspects; changing an aspect can require a different entity. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-dm/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:5e624b57f05372058736edd806905b5d4f832e58cffef11b14218d7c5efa5240",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:efbb2bd6072b746273821bdc08244cc7d7c6bdaf686fa84a587c6c314f868419"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The temporal database glossary distinguishes uncertain valid time from transaction time maintained by the database. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www2.cs.arizona.edu/~rts/pubs/TRmerged.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:14babfd4f72e723ace879585f9e0d74d68e3dfc00668f178bc03e2c88462258c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:255f6414ba7b6866104fb56c7aa5281490f13483587c77d235bed8107e284801"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fact transferred between databases can carry several transaction-time histories. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www2.cs.arizona.edu/~rts/pubs/TRmerged.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8e8f4ff4dfc2a34f3be290a0519216e16be0cb7d134fec95fb029368bb6a9bd6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:04c0797231c65d52cf48e217d9c729c6aa2f15460a62601f930b0d1bd36379bd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Different modeled perspectives can assign different valid times to the same fact. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www2.cs.arizona.edu/~rts/pubs/TRmerged.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:e3be3f79e092259b8155037f6752a3b202d4be21db75d43aa095a6bca5002d28",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:04c0797231c65d52cf48e217d9c729c6aa2f15460a62601f930b0d1bd36379bd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "XTDB v1's bitemporality does not itself implement persisted-query replay and cascading retroactive corrections. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://v1-docs.xtdb.com/concepts/bitemporality/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:db62b622c748cd52b8af068336c6f873d990bf8d90051327aad95847a0f1a797",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:f2647e9b974f3797b9d99032c3ebcdb0071ab0e5143c7b5ceba882699c7cda92"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An immutable record of an action's inputs can satisfy some audit needs without a complete bitemporal property history. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://martinfowler.com/articles/bitemporal-history.html",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8828cbb989d30c38c812fa81fa8b0a8436a1c356ec3d4782cf2fe9351635fb7e",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:a6e96c87bd4158f919db6b62d47fa92f4a2a79fad43aea516e624314f1b36116"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PROV quotation describes copied content, whereas revision describes a revised version of an earlier entity. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-dm/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:ba4cc885d9ba614f9c58c35f46bc83e9b88e54426f4566b655e657b08890bbe5",
